  "passive_endpoint_numbering": "Two-terminal PDF passives do not display numbered pins. endpoint_nets are unordered and native pin numbers must be assigned after symbol inspection.",
  "regulator_note": "No external regulator is inside JTAG/UART block. U23 internal1.8V regulator pins50/49 feed core pins12/37/64. Upper page POWER circuitry is outside this task block.",
  "conflicts": [
    {
      "severity": "functional",
      "subject": "FT2232HL versus combined FT4232HL/FT2232HL source U23",
